{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Maplora 是一款用填色地圖記錄旅行足跡的工具，適合足跡遍及多國、想整理行程與照片的旅行者。它以 197 個國家與 7 大洲為基礎，讓你標記已到訪、想去與家鄉，所有記錄只留在自己的 iPhone，毋須帳戶亦不設訂閱。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-96.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>立體地球記錄旅行版圖</h2>\n<p>Maplora 把 197 個國家與 7 大洲化成可填色地圖，讓你標記已到訪、想去與家鄉，並在立體地球或平面地圖之間切換。每個國家可記錄多趟行程，填上日期、城市與備註，再選擇假期、公幹或背包遊等類型。應用會計算探索世界的百分比、各大洲進度與年度回顧，並以護照印章與 22 個里程碑記錄成果。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-541-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-542-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-543-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-544-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-545-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-546-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Maplora: Travel Map Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/maplora-travel-map-tracker/id6801310004?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:30.204424+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T17:47:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T18:38:10.493297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:23.852525+00:00","content_hash":"f16b2c5cc0bf909662cf7074841226e1c7d76317f777af2ca48619951863e240","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:30.204424+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}